{"id":"6996aaff4caeacce","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-consistency.md","title":"Consistency","display":"df-consistency — Consistency","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-consistency","aliases":["58-df-consistency","Consistency","Logical Consistency"],"display":"df-consistency — Consistency","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-theory.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-proof.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-contradiction.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-consistency</span><span>Consistency</span><span>Logical Consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-consistency — Consistency"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"90ce6acf0c65af45\" href=\"?note=90ce6acf0c65af45\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-theory.md\">../batch08/58-df-theory.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"68fd6aebcf2cd4ac\" href=\"?note=68fd6aebcf2cd4ac\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-proof.md\">../batch04/58-df-proof.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a25ca28a0f14be03\" href=\"?note=a25ca28a0f14be03\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-contradiction.md\">../batch04/58-df-contradiction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,\\Sigma,\\mathcal P,\\bot\\in V\">\\(T,\\Sigma,\\mathcal P,\\bot\\in V\\)</span> (theory, signature, proof system, and contradiction formula)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak C=\\langle\\Sigma,\\mathcal P,\\bot\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak C=\\langle\\Sigma,\\mathcal P,\\bot\\rangle\\)</span> (the designated proof context for the unary compatibility notation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}(T,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Theory}(T,\\Sigma)\\)</span> (language-indexed theory predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"90ce6acf0c65af45\" href=\"?note=90ce6acf0c65af45\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-theory.md\">../batch08/58-df-theory.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ContradictionStructure}_S(\\bot,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{ContradictionStructure}_S(\\bot,\\Sigma)\\)</span> (contradiction-formula predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a25ca28a0f14be03\" href=\"?note=a25ca28a0f14be03\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-contradiction.md\">../batch04/58-df-contradiction.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,T,\\bot,\\mathcal P,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,T,\\bot,\\mathcal P,\\Sigma)\\)</span> (proof-object predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"68fd6aebcf2cd4ac\" href=\"?note=68fd6aebcf2cd4ac\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-proof.md\">../batch04/58-df-proof.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsistentTheory}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ConsistentTheory}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (precise predicate and designated-context alias defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistent\\text{-}theory} \\vdash \\mathrm{ConsistentTheory}_S(T,\\mathcal P,\\Sigma,\\bot)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Theory}(T,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{ContradictionStructure}_S(\\bot,\\Sigma)\\land\\neg\\exists\\pi\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,T,\\bot,\\mathcal P,\\Sigma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistent\\text{-}theory} \\vdash \\mathrm{ConsistentTheory}_S(T,\\mathcal P,\\Sigma,\\bot)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Theory}(T,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{ContradictionStructure}_S(\\bot,\\Sigma)\\land\\neg\\exists\\pi\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,T,\\bot,\\mathcal P,\\Sigma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistency} \\vdash \\mathfrak C=\\langle\\Sigma,\\mathcal P,\\bot\\rangle\\to\\bigl(\\mathrm{Con}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ConsistentTheory}_S(T,\\mathcal P,\\Sigma,\\bot)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistency} \\vdash \\mathfrak C=\\langle\\Sigma,\\mathcal P,\\bot\\rangle\\to\\bigl(\\mathrm{Con}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ConsistentTheory}_S(T,\\mathcal P,\\Sigma,\\bot)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>语法一致性</strong>: 在显式语言、证明系统和矛盾式下，不存在从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 推出的矛盾。</li>\n<li>The four-argument predicate is the portable definition; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_S(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_S(T)\\)</span> is only the compatibility notation relative to the designated context <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak C\">\\(\\mathfrak C\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Equivalent syntactic form: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\;\\neg(T\\vdash\\varphi\\land\\neg\\varphi)\">\\(\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\;\\neg(T\\vdash\\varphi\\land\\neg\\varphi)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><strong>语义可满足性</strong>: 存在结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\models T\">\\(\\mathcal M\\models T\\)</span>；对一阶逻辑，它与语法一致性的等价性依赖完备性定理。</li>\n<li><strong>相对一致性</strong>: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_S(T)\\to\\mathrm{Con}_S(T+\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_S(T)\\to\\mathrm{Con}_S(T+\\varphi)\\)</span> 必须由具体的相对一致性证明建立，并非定义自动给出。</li>\n<li><strong>Henkin 定理</strong>: 完全理论可展开为可满足理论</li>\n<li><strong>Godel 第二不完备定理</strong>: 足够强的递归可枚举理论不能证明自身一致性</li>\n<li>若 ZFC 一致，则 ZFC<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\\mathrm{CH}\">\\(+\\mathrm{CH}\\)</span> 与 ZFC<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\\neg\\mathrm{CH}\">\\(+\\neg\\mathrm{CH}\\)</span> 都一致；这给出相对一致性，而不是这里所写一致性陈述之间的严格强度链。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Enderton, A Mathematical Introduction to Logic, §2.6</li>\n<li>Jech, Set Theory, Chapter 12 (Model Theory)</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"90ce6acf0c65af45","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-theory.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-proof.md","status":"resolved","id":"68fd6aebcf2cd4ac","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-proof.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-contradiction.md","status":"resolved","id":"a25ca28a0f14be03","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-contradiction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-the